<title>USA: Ultrafem says expands Instead distribution. [Corrected 21:10 gmt]</title>
<headline>Ultrafem says expands Instead distribution. [Corrected 21:10 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultrafem Inc said on Friday that it had reached agreements with three drug retailers that would add 6,800 stores to the distribution network of its Instead feminine protection product (corrects from &quot;birthcontrol device&quot;).</p>
<p>Under the agreements, the three retailers, CVS Corp Rite Aid and Revco, will begin distributing Instead during July to September, Ultrafem said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that Instead will generate incremental sales for these retailers and have a major, positive influence on their bottom line,&quot; said chief executive John Andersen.</p>
</text>
